.PS
# basic/depsrc.cir drawn: the four dependent sources, each into its own
# load, all controlled by the 2 V source V1 — the VCVS (x2.5) and the
# VCCS (1 mS) by its voltage (top row, wired to it), the CCCS (x10) and
# the CCVS (-500 ohm) by its current i(v1) = -2 mA (bottom row, named
# in the card). Card order kept; deck nodes 1 Vc, 2 Ve, 3 Vg, 4 Vf,
# 5 Vh.
spice = 1
Vc: (0.3,5.6)
Ve: (2.8,5)
Vg: (5.2,5)
Vf: (1.5,2)
Vh: (4.2,2)

V1: vsource((0.3,5.6), (0.3,3), dc 2)
R1: resistor((1.1,5.6), (1.1,3), 1k)
E1: vcvs((2.8,5), (2.8,3), (2.3,4.2), (2.3,3.8), 2.5)
RE: resistor((4,5), (4,3), 1k)
G1: vccs((5.2,3), (5.2,5), (4.7,4.2), (4.7,3.8), 1m)
RG: resistor((6.4,5), (6.4,3), 2k)
F1: cccs((1.5,0), (1.5,2), v1 10, "10 i(V1)")
RF: resistor((2.5,2), (2.5,0), 100)
H1: ccvs((4.2,2), (4.2,0), v1 -500, "−500 i(V1)")
RH: resistor((5.2,2), (5.2,0), 1k)

line from V1.P to R1.P then to (4.4,5.6)
line from (2,5.6) to (2,4.2) then to E1.Cp
line from E1.Cn to (2,3.8) then to (2,3)
line from (4.4,5.6) to (4.4,4.2) then to G1.Cp
line from G1.Cn to (4.4,3.8) then to (4.4,3)
line from E1.P to RE.P
line from G1.N to RG.P
line from V1.N to RG.N
line from F1.N to RF.P
line from H1.P to RH.P
line from F1.P to RH.N
dot at R1.P; dot at (2,5.6)
dot at R1.N; dot at (2,3); dot at E1.N; dot at RE.N; dot at (4.4,3); dot at G1.P
dot at RF.N; dot at H1.N
ground((0.7,3)); ground((3.3,0))
.op
.PE
